     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The number of combinations of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"nCr = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The answer will always be an integer, so check your math if you get a fraction.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6C4 = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{6!}}{{4!\\left( {6 - 4} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{6!}}{{4!2!}} = \\frac{{6 \\times 5 \\times \\cancel{{4!}}}}{{\\cancel{{4!}} \\times 2 \\times 1}} = \\frac{{30}}{2} = 15\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "15"
    }
   ],
