     "content_html": "<p>The number of combinations of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"nCr = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The answer will always be an integer, so check your math if you get a fraction.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"10C8 = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{10!}}{{8!\\left( {10 - 8} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{10!}}{{8!2!}} = \\frac{{10 \\times 9 \\times \\cancel{{8!}}}}{{\\cancel{{8!}} \\times 2 \\times 1}} = \\frac{{90}}{2} = 45\"></span></p>\n"
