     "content_html": "<p>The number of combinations of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"nCr = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The answer will always be an integer, so check your math if you get a fraction.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"14C5 = \\frac{{n!}}{{r!\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{14!}}{{5!\\left( {14 - 5} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{14!}}{{5!9!}} = \\frac{{14 \\times 13 \\times 12 \\times 11 \\times 10 \\times \\cancel{{9!}}}}{{5 \\times 4 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1 \\times \\cancel{{9!}}}} = \\frac{{240,240}}{{120}} = 2,002\"></span></p>"
